## Article

```catala
declaration enumeration Situation:
  -- Married content integer
  -- Single

declaration scope A:
  input s content Situation
  input i content optional of integer
  output o content integer

scope A:
  definition o equals
    match s, i with pattern
    -- Married content n, Present content m : n
    -- Married content n, Absent : 1
    -- Married content k, Present content m : k
    -- Single, anything : 3
```

